		)
		(uuid "552c5835-1660-493d-97ed-0715db23d0dd")
	)
	(text_box "GPIO9 used for LED signalling in production.\nUsing low-side switch to avoid any current leakage.\nShould not interfere with bootstrapping behaviour, normally float with internal pullup to high = normal boot"
